    "description": "<p>You ready and bludgeon the ammunition used with your chakra, aiming for your target's core striking at the center of their chest.</p>\n<p>Make a ranged taijutsu Attack using your weapon, dealing your [Weapons damage] + 3d6 as bludgeoning damage. On a hit, the target must succeed a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the target is Dazed</p>\n<p>Chain 1: If the affected creature would make a concentration check they suffer a -2 penalty to the check.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank, you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increasing the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
